  <h2 class="section-title">Generator → Battery → Boiler Heater · Self-Sustaining Loop</h2>
  <p class="section-lead">
    LiFePO4 battery pack at 48V / 100Ah. Generator charges battery while engine runs. Battery powers 2kW boiler heater on cold start and supplements at low RPM.
    At operating speed (300 RPM) generator produces ~3,600W, boiler maintenance draws ~800W, net surplus ~2,800W continuously charging battery.
    System is self-sustaining once running. 12V alternator feeds vehicle electrics via DC-DC converter.
