      <h3>5-Layer Boiler Protection</h3>
      <p>Layer 1: PCW electronic throttle closes at 150 PSI. Layer 2: PRV spring vents at 155 PSI (×3 independent). Layer 3: Fusible plug melts at low water / 170°C. Layer 4: Burst disc rated 340 PSI (2.3× operating). Layer 5: Manual steam dump valve accessible from driver position.</p>
      <p>Any single failure still leaves 4 remaining protection layers. ASME compliant stack. All PRVs independently calibrated and tagged.</p>
