      <li>LiFePO4 battery is the single most expensive off-shelf component at ~$2,300</li>
      <li>4-speed gearbox ($2,850) can be sourced secondhand from donor vehicle to reduce cost significantly</li>
      <li>Total is competitive — a well-specified custom steam vehicle for under $42,000 including chassis and all systems is achievable</li>
      <li>Does NOT include road registration, insurance, testing fees, or Phase 20 development costs</li>
